atis-relay-host (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show the ATIS Relay window on launch; closing the window quits the app.
  * Let the installing desktop user read the station config without sudo.
  * Add remote control and the RTL-SDR Blog V4 driver installer.
  * Require admin authentication for driver install, remote-commands, and reboot.
  * Own /etc/atis-relay as root:atis-relay and write env without following symlinks.

 -- Torrey Systems <deploy@atisrelay.com>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0000

